exports[`case hub > confirmed facts, nexus complete 1`] = `"<main><h1>Your discharge-upgrade case</h1><section><h2>1. Service facts</h2><p>Army, discharged 2001-02-03 (General (Under Honorable Conditions)). <a href="/case/intake">Edit</a></p></section><section><h2>2. Where your case goes</h2><p><strong>Fixture Review Board</strong> — file <strong>DD Form 293</strong></p><p>The Discharge Review Board window is open until 2099-01-01.</p><ul><li>The correction board has a 3-year filing rule, but it is routinely waived in the interest of justice.</li></ul><p>This is the computed filing route for the facts you confirmed — it is process information, not legal advice.</p></section><section><h2>3. Evidence</h2><p><a href="/case/evidence">Build your evidence checklist</a></p></section><section><h2>4. Nexus — the four questions</h2><p><a href="/case/nexus">Answer the four Kurta questions</a> — 4 of 4 answered.</p></section><section><h2>5. Draft — statement and cover letter</h2><p><a href="/case/draft">Generate and edit your draft documents</a></p></section><section><h2>6. Packet — assemble and download</h2><p><a href="/case/packet">Review your filing packet</a></p></section><form action="/auth/signout" method="post"><button type="submit">Sign out</button></form><p><a href="/settings/data">Your data — export or delete everything</a></p></main>"`;

